Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:12.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助的眼中再次浮现出神秘画面……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.60,0:00:17.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那是哥哥以前看过的景象。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.77,0:00:22.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,梦人已经策划了两起犯罪。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.51,0:00:27.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,借助神秘的左眼，爱之助试图与哥哥对抗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:32.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,左眼侦探EYE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.06,0:00:39.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥策划的连环绑架案开始了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.23,0:00:44.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第一起案件中，犯人派了狗去取100万日元的赎金。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.11,0:00:48.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第二起案件中，被绑架的八岁女孩的母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:52.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没能筹齐所需的400万日元。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.55,0:00:54.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,尽管钱不够，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.33,0:00:56.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,她还是把钱绑在鸽子身上放飞了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.37,0:00:58.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人借口钱不够，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.96,0:01:01.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把小舞留在了危险的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.62,0:01:05.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助，住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:09.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这次会换成别的动物。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.15,0:01:12.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,多亏了左眼，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:16.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我推断出了小舞所在的位置。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.33,0:01:20.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,接着，救下小舞的是……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.38,0:01:23.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一名警察。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:25.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.70,0:01:27.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.87,0:01:32.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,弟弟，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.14,0:01:36.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真正的较量现在才要开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.63,0:01:41.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第2集
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.04,0:01:46.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你真的把密码解开了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.23,0:01:50.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,让我好好解了闷呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:56.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不愧是犯罪天才。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:08.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.75,0:02:10.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在把笔记本电脑交给我。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:14.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我又重新设了防。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.04,0:02:16.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.04,0:02:19.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我有一个条件。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.45,0:02:27.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,放我出去，再给我一把枪。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.85,0:02:31.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,让我能杀人，而且不用再坐牢。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.85,0:02:34.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了！我绝不可能答应！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:38.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你确定你现在的处境能对我说这种话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.70,0:02:42.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绑架还会继续。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.38,0:03:03.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,凛，我回来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.86,0:03:14.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,该怎么办呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.76,0:03:16.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,或许大家还没察觉到，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.44,0:03:18.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但实际上已经发生了3起绑架。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.65,0:03:23.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果你把我的事告诉任何人，第三名人质就会死。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:43.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我回来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.39,0:03:47.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,听说绑架案还在继续？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.85,0:03:52.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,先是用了狗，然后是鸽子，接着是海狮。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.14,0:03:54.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人掌控了陆海空啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:59.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,想出这个计划的人真是个天才。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.96,0:04:02.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,实际上已经发生了3起绑架。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.35,0:04:08.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:10.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,从昨晚开始肚子就有点痛。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:14.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,早上好！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:19.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我这就去给你拿点东西，等一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:21.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师，您还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.95,0:04:25.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:31.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是最好的药。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.93,0:04:41.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哇，溶解了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:44.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.41,0:04:47.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助，你差不多该去上学了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.97,0:04:49.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.51,0:04:52.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请大家看第62页的例题。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.94,0:04:57.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在左眼看到的画面中，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.61,0:05:01.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个……还有这个我已经弄明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.39,0:05:05.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.09,0:05:11.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“M会死”。这里的M肯定是指小舞。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.01,0:05:14.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那么，还没弄明白的……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:17.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就是这个……还有……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:18.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.90,0:05:27.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师，我想问您点事……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.92,0:05:36.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树，你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.37,0:05:39.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没什么，只是有点贫血。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.57,0:05:41.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,记得要好好吃饭。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.47,0:05:45.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.89,0:05:48.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.90,0:05:56.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要还清所有债务……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:05:59.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,竟然要花15年？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.73,0:06:00.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:03.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 我的人生全完了……\N- 老师！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.09,0:06:06.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哎呀，爱之助，早上好。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:07.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您才注意到啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.11,0:06:10.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂，这里是保健室，我是狭山。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.21,0:06:12.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是YY金融的谷田部。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.76,0:06:22.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,身为保健老师欠了这么大一笔债，不觉得害臊吗？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.42,0:06:28.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我可不想去你家贴满“欠债还钱”的讨债单。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:30.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.25,0:06:32.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我会还的！我一定会还的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.10,0:06:35.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然需要一点时间，但我会有悬赏金收入的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:39.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定会还的！我保证！请别再打电话来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:47.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我该怎么办啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.86,0:07:01.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.68,0:07:03.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没、没什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.80,0:07:11.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,打扰了。我感觉好多了，先回去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:13.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别太勉强了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:15.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树，一起走吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.83,0:07:22.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对了，听说昨天又发生了一起绑架案。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.64,0:07:25.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,早间新闻里播了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:28.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好像是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.26,0:07:31.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:35.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那次是你报的警吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.56,0:07:39.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看到鸽子之后，你说了一句奇怪的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.80,0:07:43.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,果然。鸽子是指下一起绑架案吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.23,0:07:51.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能告诉我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.17,0:07:55.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么这么问？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.73,0:07:57.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.76,0:08:02.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我只是无法原谅那个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.11,0:08:05.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,专门伤害穷人的犯人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.49,0:08:10.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那种人不配活在世上。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.50,0:08:12.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我也这么觉得。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.41,0:08:20.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但幕后黑手到底是谁呢……？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.61,0:08:27.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我觉得不止一个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.15,0:08:33.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算不是，那个人也更没有活着的资格。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:41.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,千万别告诉任何人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.70,0:08:46.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其实……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.05,0:08:50.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有时候我的直觉会告诉我……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.79,0:08:54.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你觉得这个怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:57.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看起来像鸽子……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.11,0:09:03.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但我之前看到的鸽子要更清晰。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:07.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这里面有些东西让我很在意。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.95,0:09:11.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起，我不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.37,0:09:15.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我猜也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.77,0:09:20.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好吧，我家在那边……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.77,0:09:22.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再见。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:32.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,话说，难道……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.51,0:09:33.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:37.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道你……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:53.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.59,0:10:15.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,梦人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.28,0:10:22.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,顺便说一下，第三起绑架案来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.98,0:10:26.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你不是说已经发生过了吗？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.79,0:10:28.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那是骗你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.53,0:10:34.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是不这么做，你就会把我的事告诉别人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.35,0:10:38.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,作为补偿，我送你一份礼物。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.47,0:10:41.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.37,0:10:47.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是专门为你准备的奖励关卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.27,0:10:51.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等！哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.17,0:10:52.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:55.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,受害者是海藤正树，15岁。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.45,0:10:57.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他遭到袭击，被强行拽上了车。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:11:00.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,目击者是他同校的朋友田中爱之助。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.65,0:11:01.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又是那个中学生……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.85,0:11:04.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他没能记下车牌号，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:06.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也没看清犯人的长相，因为对方戴着面具。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.85,0:11:09.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,受害者家里只有母亲一人。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.28,0:11:11.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,海藤早苗，35岁，上门护理员。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:13.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,索要的赎金是——
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:15.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,900万日元。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.00,0:11:17.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,目前还没有交付赎金的具体指示。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.25,0:11:18.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,恕我冒昧，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.35,0:11:22.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但要求的金额实在太大，家属可能筹不齐。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.58,0:11:24.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为了避免人质像上次那样陷入危险，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.63,0:11:27.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们警方能不能在赎金上提供一点支援？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.94,0:11:30.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,规定就是规定。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.49,0:11:32.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警方绝不能向犯人提供资金。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.97,0:11:33.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:35.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人的目的到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:41.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不可能的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.86,0:11:45.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,900万日元数额太大了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:49.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树身体本来就弱，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.44,0:11:52.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再这样下去他会没命的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.45,0:11:56.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求你们，救救他吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.77,0:11:59.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了！求求你们！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.70,0:12:08.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们很遗憾，但按规定赎金必须由家属筹集。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.72,0:12:15.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这么说，你们是要对穷人家的孩子见死不救吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.22,0:12:17.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我不是这个意思……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:18.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我能理解您的心情，但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.02,0:12:30.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,900万日元……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.90,0:12:37.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样……那么大一笔钱……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.01,0:12:40.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,打扰了……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.64,0:12:42.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.27,0:12:47.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他是案件的目击者。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.05,0:12:50.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是正树在学校的朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.23,0:12:54.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是狭山，保健老师。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.65,0:12:57.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想请问一下……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.91,0:13:01.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您认识一位姓神谷的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.13,0:13:08.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,神谷先生是我工作公司的社长。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.63,0:13:27.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我儿子是我唯一宝贵的依靠。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.33,0:13:32.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求您，救救他吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:36.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我理解您的心情。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:45.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是，如果遇到这种事每次都帮员工垫钱，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.78,0:13:49.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯罪分子就会没完没了地盯上我们。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.64,0:13:52.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您看这次能不能破个例……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.94,0:14:00.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,以我的收入，根本不可能筹到900万日元。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.21,0:14:02.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求您了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.93,0:14:11.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,神谷社长，不如我们做个交易吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.31,0:14:14.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果您这次伸出援手，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.24,0:14:21.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警方会通过媒体向神谷公司公开表达谢意。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.33,0:14:23.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.82,0:14:29.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要能抓住犯人并追回这900万日元，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.62,0:14:31.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我就没有理由拒绝。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:34.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,当然。我以警察的尊严担保。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:36.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:51.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真是太感谢您了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.65,0:14:55.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,失陪一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.91,0:14:57.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.13,0:14:59.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:08.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人好像把指示信和附带的袋子寄到了受害者家里。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.45,0:15:12.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要求把900万日元装进袋子里，明天上午10点送过去。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:14.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是指名人质的母亲去送吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.51,0:15:20.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,信上说，必须由受害者的朋友田中爱之助去送。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.68,0:15:24.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:26.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.91,0:15:31.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,电话监听已就绪。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.48,0:15:32.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好。下一个。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.43,0:15:35.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,发信器检查完毕。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:36.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好。下一个。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.57,0:15:40.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,田中爱之助的公寓已由A组负责监视。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.15,0:15:42.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所有人原地待命。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.39,0:15:43.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.23,0:15:43.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,下一个。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:51.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:54.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.49,0:15:58.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树就在我眼前被抓走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:01.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而我却什么都做不了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.64,0:16:02.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.24,0:16:05.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.68,0:16:09.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么指名让我去送赎金？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.52,0:16:12.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想不通哥哥的目的到底是什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.96,0:16:17.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他一直都比我聪明得多。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.26,0:16:23.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我怎么可能赢得了他？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.15,0:16:27.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其实变聪明很简单的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.91,0:16:29.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.68,0:16:33.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要换个角度看问题就行。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.74,0:16:37.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,换个角度看这些绑架案……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:43.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这些案件的另一面……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.18,0:16:54.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还是不明白……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.94,0:16:59.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所有人0800前就位！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:00.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,以上。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.41,0:17:01.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.99,0:17:12.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,田中爱之助……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.36,0:17:18.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,调查结束了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.31,0:17:19.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.84,0:17:36.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.75,0:17:38.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加油。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.48,0:17:42.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.01,0:17:49.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加油啊，爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.62,0:17:53.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过居然要900万日元啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:28.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.76,0:18:31.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是田中爱之助吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.77,0:18:33.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.90,0:18:37.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在路上别往包里看，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.78,0:18:40.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,免得被人看到钱。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.99,0:18:52.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对了，你有兄弟姐妹吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:18:57.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有个哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:18:59.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哦，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.46,0:19:01.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他是个怎样的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.83,0:19:06.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他非常聪明，人也很好……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.24,0:19:09.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.45,0:19:12.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他已经死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.17,0:19:16.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哎呀，真遗憾。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.07,0:19:20.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过就算是好人……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.09,0:19:23.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,迟早也都会死的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.95,0:19:26.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,附近的车站有投币式储物柜。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.40,0:19:30.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,接下来的指示在12号柜子里。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.69,0:19:34.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果30分钟内赶不到，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.38,0:19:38.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你就准备跟你的朋友说永别吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.73,0:19:51.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,电话监听怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.70,0:19:52.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,情况不对。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.60,0:19:54.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有设备屏蔽了信号，我们无法破解拦截。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.19,0:19:56.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是从哪里打来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.90,0:19:58.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,目前还无法确定。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.11,0:20:00.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,信号先绕到海外中转，所以无法追踪。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:12.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等！这是我的柜子！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:20.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你干什么？干嘛吓人啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.84,0:20:27.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我得赶快！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:28.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抱歉了，加藤先生。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.85,0:21:34.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,甩掉跟踪你的人，去清风公园。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.04,0:21:38.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要有一个人跟着你，游戏就结束了。\N把他们甩掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.99,0:21:59.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,变装原来这么简单啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.99,0:22:12.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这位女士！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.63,0:22:15.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还差30日元。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.73,0:22:17.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我赶时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.30,0:22:19.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,刚才出去的那个男生是我的学生。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.93,0:22:24.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我必须跟上他！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.55,0:22:29.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！爱之助！借我30日元！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.32,0:22:33.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起，老师。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.12,0:22:43.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是福地。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.19,0:22:44.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？跟丢了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.99,0:22:48.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,追踪发信器的信号。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.15,0:22:51.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 向指挥部汇报情况。\N- 是。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.06,0:23:01.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 福地警视，恕我冒昧，但我有点在意一件事。\N- 什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.33,0:23:08.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果这次也是利用动物的犯人，会不会这次也打算用动物？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.46,0:23:12.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不好意思，我们是警察。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.91,0:23:15.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 跑了！\N- 加藤先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.04,0:23:21.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狭山老师！你怎么在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.38,0:23:24.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 能借我30日元吗？\N- 啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:29.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 爱之助！\N- 加藤先生！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.40,0:24:02.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 赶得不错。\N- 这到底还要持续多久？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.92,0:24:08.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看到长椅旁边的垃圾桶了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.55,0:24:13.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,去里面看看。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.60,0:24:33.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,去河边。限你20分钟。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.07,0:25:06.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来你赶上了。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.92,0:25:20.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你应该看到码头了吧。坐上橡皮艇，解开锁。然后一直往前划。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.71,0:26:39.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.76,0:26:53.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,海上的感觉不错吧？可以不用划了。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.93,0:26:59.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在大声拍4下手。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.15,0:27:30.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 出现动物了。是海豚。\N- 果然是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.02,0:27:34.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,留在原地等待进一步指示。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.24,0:27:45.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果陆地上是狗，天空是鸽子，那这次轮到水里也是顺理成章的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.80,0:27:55.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把钱交给海豚。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.15,0:27:59.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把包绑在圆环上。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.74,0:28:59.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助，爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.25,0:29:04.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？\N- 没受伤吧？都还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.94,0:29:11.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 你们怎么知道我在这儿？\N- 福地警官说你可能会来这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.96,0:29:25.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,海豚游走了。包沉在水底，我们捞上来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.70,0:29:30.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？那就是说900万日元还在里面？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.20,0:29:34.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么都没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.65,0:29:37.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.54,0:29:39.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.36,0:29:42.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,包拿到了，但钱不见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.40,0:29:49.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好……知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.31,0:29:56.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助，福地警官想问你几个问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.75,0:30:02.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 什么？\N- 他认为只有你才有可能把钱拿走。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.23,0:30:05.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.61,0:30:13.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你就是田中爱之助吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.09,0:30:24.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我什么都没做，只是按照犯人的指示去送赎金而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.65,0:30:30.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你好像跟犯人通了电话。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.58,0:30:35.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道你认识犯人？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.83,0:30:38.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不认识。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.21,0:30:40.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别撒谎了，没用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.95,0:30:49.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果你把我的事告诉任何人，第三名人质就会死。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.38,0:30:52.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我真的什么都不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.79,0:31:05.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可能是因为他知道我帮着救了小舞……所以怀恨在心。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.05,0:31:09.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可去送钱的人明明就是你。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.76,0:31:18.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且跟犯人通话的也是你。你自己就没想过会被怀疑吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.51,0:31:25.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助绝对不可能是犯人。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.16,0:31:29.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警察全是一群笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.51,0:31:37.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,既然这样，我一定要证明爱之助的清白。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.42,0:31:41.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我能帮上什么忙呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.80,0:31:50.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,画的复印件有时候能派上大用场。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.36,0:31:55.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这座雕像在之前的案件里还没出现过……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.50,0:32:04.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人到底是谁？你把钱藏到哪儿去了？又是怎么藏的？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.02,0:32:11.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在你说出实话之前，谁都不会放你走的。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.72,0:32:26.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果你涉案，那就说明赎金为100万和400万日元的前两起绑架案也跟你有关。对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.14,0:32:45.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没错。我左眼看到的那些平方，可能和赎金数额有关。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.92,0:32:54.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,10的平方是100，20的平方是400，30的平方是900。\N很有可能，因为哥哥很喜欢数学。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.91,0:32:58.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要换个角度看问题就行。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.94,0:33:02.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,换个角度看那个聪明人……
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.34,0:33:19.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道说？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.79,0:33:34.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 如果我抓到真正的犯人，你们能相信我是清白的吗？\N- 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.91,0:33:39.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.32,0:33:56.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来M指的是正树。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.58,0:34:01.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.59,0:34:07.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 正树有生命危险！\N- 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.65,0:34:10.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有一个人可能把钱拿走。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.55,0:34:12.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.36,0:34:14.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,报告！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.10,0:34:18.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人联系了人质的母亲。说已经拿到钱了，明天就会把儿子送回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.29,0:34:23.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 不，来不及了！再不采取行动，正树就会死！\N- 明明是你自己把钱交给犯人的！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.04,0:34:31.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生，快打电话给狭山老师，把我画的那座雕像发给她。正树肯定就在那附近。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.24,0:34:36.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不对，不是这张……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.21,0:34:42.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是这个吗？找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.22,0:34:48.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树应该在1106号房间。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.32,0:34:54.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂，狭山老师？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.80,0:35:02.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 明白了，我这就转告他。\N她说那座雕像在“Sea West酒店”旁边。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.45,0:35:04.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.16,0:35:11.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求您放我走吧。之后您就全明白了。拜托了。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.67,0:35:19.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好吧，快去。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.26,0:35:46.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.33,0:35:50.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 正树！\N- 爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.09,0:35:54.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.78,0:36:05.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 加藤先生，拿毛巾来。\N好！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.81,0:36:08.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,海藤，撑住啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.55,0:36:11.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,海藤！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.22,0:36:14.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 海藤，你怎么样？\N- 我去向领导汇报。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.86,0:36:19.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助，像这样按住。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.39,0:36:25.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 加藤先生……\N- 正树！正树！千万别死啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.97,0:36:30.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树！别死啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.13,0:36:52.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.34,0:36:57.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树他受了伤，现在在医院。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.77,0:37:01.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？怎么可能……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.05,0:37:06.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没错，本不该这样的。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.65,0:37:17.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果他的母亲不是犯人，正树根本就不会出事。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.15,0:37:26.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您只是想让自己和正树过上好日子吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.92,0:37:35.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我向警方争取了5分钟的时间跟您谈谈。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.29,0:37:48.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狗和鸽子其实都只是幌子。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.05,0:37:53.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,从一开始，您的目标就是那900万日元。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.77,0:38:01.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,利用动物，是为了在最后这起案子里把警方的注意力全引到海豚身上。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.51,0:38:18.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在把钱放进包里之前，您就换成了溶于水的假币。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.22,0:38:25.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,胡说八道。你有证据吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.08,0:38:35.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是我在正树那里找到的。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.50,0:38:48.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树在自己家里发现了一根白色羽毛，就是第二起绑架案里用到的鸽子的羽毛。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.66,0:39:00.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树本想相信自己的妈妈，但被绑架后，他就明白幕后主使是谁了。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.28,0:39:05.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以，在他来到酒店之后……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.59,0:39:15.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,妈妈，对不起……都是我的错……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.84,0:39:22.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果没有我，这一切就不会发生了。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.34,0:39:27.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,傻孩子，别这么说。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.13,0:39:35.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树！正树！正树！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.19,0:39:41.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请您自首吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.82,0:39:46.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,说出真相吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.14,0:39:53.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,凭您一个人，根本策划不出这一切吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.77,0:40:00.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我真的能拿到900万日元吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.41,0:40:08.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的，而且绝不会有人死伤。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.72,0:40:15.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一切都交由我们来安排。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.88,0:40:28.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,当然，绑架你儿子的时候，我们自有全盘计划。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.99,0:40:41.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个到时候应该能派上用场。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.23,0:41:18.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.92,0:41:49.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们该不会又被耍了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.93,0:41:54.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不，我们已经抓到犯人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.04,0:42:01.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我看事情没那么简单，是他们故意让人抓到的。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.18,0:42:07.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个犯罪天才利用人性的弱点在操纵他们。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.33,0:42:15.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过，我总觉得你其实并没有解开那台电脑的密码。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.95,0:42:25.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,婚礼、犯罪计划、赎金……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.77,0:42:27.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.77,0:42:36.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这一系列的绑架，不过是为真正的犯罪做准备罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.98,0:42:50.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真没想到妈妈竟然会为了我去犯罪。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.86,0:42:54.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不是那样的。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.75,0:43:00.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,错不在你。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.12,0:43:08.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,错的是那些利用你妈妈的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.03,0:43:24.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然这么说可能有点奇怪，但我一定会替你讨回公道。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.71,0:43:28.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.58,0:43:41.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定会抓住毁掉你们生活的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.24,0:43:58.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂，你要去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.25,0:44:11.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我有重要的事情必须告诉福地警视和加藤。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.42,0:44:15.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是关于绑架案的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.71,0:44:19.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,关于绑架案？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.29,0:44:27.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其实策划这一连串绑架案的……是我哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.67,0:44:52.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不要！音濑先生！音濑先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.98,0:44:56.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快叫救护车！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.62,0:45:01.65,SongTop,,0,0,0,,即使眼中映出的世界满是悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.33,0:45:00.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,音濑先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.73,0:45:03.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快叫救护车！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.84,0:45:07.16,SongTop,,0,0,0,,我们的青春物语也绝不再逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.38,0:45:13.42,SongTop,,0,0,0,,凝视前方 一定能寻找到光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.50,0:45:21.33,SongTop,,0,0,0,,因为想看到泪水过后的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.43,0:45:28.13,SongTop,,0,0,0,,就算对未来感到不安 也不要敷衍逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.28,0:45:34.56,SongTop,,0,0,0,,不要对自己说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.85,0:45:42.02,SongTop,,0,0,0,,纵然迷茫 迷茫 再迷茫 依然怀揣梦想 追逐梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.28,0:45:48.99,SongTop,,0,0,0,,坚信这份心意终能传达 直到实现
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.30,0:45:56.90,SongTop,,0,0,0,,凝视前方 我们一定能寻找到光芒
